{"id":"641026","name":"奥尔良鸡肉汉堡","author":"清水淡竹","authorId":"8451954","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/641026/cover.jpeg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"鸡胸肉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"适量"},{"name":"生菜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"胡萝卜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"南瓜面包","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"生粉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"面包糠","amount":"适量"},{"name":"全蛋液","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"鸡胸肉切片。","img":"images/641026/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"奥尔良烤翅腌料用水调匀。","img":"images/641026/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"放入肉片拌匀放冰箱腌制2个小时以上，中途多翻拌几次。","img":"images/641026/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"生菜清洗干净控水。","img":"images/641026/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"胡萝卜切片。","img":"images/641026/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"沸水中烫熟备用。","img":"images/641026/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"鸡蛋煎好备用。","img":"images/641026/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"生粉、面包糠、鸡蛋液备用。","img":"images/641026/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"腌好的鸡胸肉粘上一层生粉。","img":"images/641026/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"粘上蛋液。","img":"images/641026/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"再粘上一层面包糠。","img":"images/641026/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"平底锅放油，放入鸡肉煎制。（也可以油多炸着吃）","img":"images/641026/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"自制的南瓜面包对半切开。","img":"images/641026/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"放上一片生菜。","img":"images/641026/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"放上鸡胸肉。","img":"images/641026/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"放上胡萝卜。","img":"images/641026/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"放上煎蛋。","img":"images/641026/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"再放上一片生菜。","img":"images/641026/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"盖上面包片，汉堡制作完成。","img":"images/641026/step_19.jpeg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：不粘锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}